- W>R | start a proper club with a password and rules, with the garden as its den | identity | v: stimulation, conformity | chance: 60
- U>G | ask the old lady next door who lived there, and listen to her whole story | door | v: tradition, self-direction | mark: made a friend | tags: win:ties+.05 | chance: 82
- B>W | offer to keep watch on the house for the neighbours, for a coin a week | v: power, security | chance: 39
