- R | scream and run for your parents' room as fast as your legs will go | body: light | v: security | chance: 92
- G | press your face to the window and watch the lightning light up the trees | v: universalism (nature), stimulation | chance: 65
- W>G | creep in to comfort your sibling, and stay until they fall asleep | v: benevolence | mark: helped someone in need | chance: 90
- U>W | find the torch where it is always kept, and light the landing for everyone | v: security, benevolence | chance: 90
